{"title":"Career Roadmap · ADAS Engineer","role":"ADAS Engineer","summary":"An ADAS (Advanced Driver Assistance Systems) Engineer develops, integrates, tests, and validates vehicle technologies that assist drivers and improve vehicle safety.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. — Engineering & Technology","Course":"Automotive Electronics / Autonomous Vehicles"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An ADAS (Advanced Driver Assistance Systems) Engineer develops, integrates, tests, and validates vehicle technologies that assist drivers and improve vehicle safety."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical ADAS systems include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB)"},{"text":"Adaptive Cruise Control (ACC)"},{"text":"Lane Departure Warning (LDW)"},{"text":"Lane Keeping Assist (LKA)"},{"text":"Blind Spot Detection"},{"text":"Traffic Sign Recognition"},{"text":"Forward Collision Warning"},{"text":"Parking Assistance"},{"text":"Driver Monitoring Systems"},{"text":"Surround-view systems"},{"text":"Automated parking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines automotive engineering, embedded systems, computer vision, sensors, control systems, AI/ML, real-time software, and vehicle testing."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","Automotive / Embedded Intern","ADAS Engineer","ADAS Software / Perception Engineer","Senior ADAS Engineer","ADAS Technical Lead","ADAS / Autonomous Driving Architect","Principal Engineer / Engineering Manager"]},{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Automotive/ADAS Intern, Embedded Engineer Trainee"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Junior ADAS Engineer"}],[{"text":"3–5 years"},{"text":"ADAS Software / Perception / Validation Engineer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior ADAS Engineer"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"ADAS Tech